DESCRIPTION:Armeni\, a few kilometres inland from Sitia\, holds the area's best-attended Dormition glenti on the night of 15 August in the schoolyard\, with a full menu (15 euros in 2025) and a name kompania (Giorgos and Nikos Stratakis in 2025)\; Paraspori nearby does its Panagia the night before. Reserve through the village association and expect it to run until 3 am.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#armeni-panigiri-of-the-dormition-armeni-sitia
